<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">STUDENT CARE</view><view class="title">每一个孩子，都值得被看见。</view><view class="subtitle">用代号记录事实，持续关注每一次变化。</view><view wx:if="error" class="warning">{{error}}</view><view class="row"><view class="tabs"><view class="tab {{filter==='all'?'selected':''}}" data-filter="all" bindtap="filter">全部档案</view><view class="tab {{filter==='followup'?'selected':''}}" data-filter="followup" bindtap="filter">待跟进</view></view><button class="primary small" bindtap="add">＋ 建立档案</button></view><input class="input search" placeholder="搜索学生代号或记录内容" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search" />
 <view wx:for="{{students}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit"><view class="row"><view class="row row-left min-width"><view class="avatar">{{item.initial}}</view><view><view class="student-code">{{item.code}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.interviewCount}} 次访谈 {{item.lastInterview?'· 最近 '+item.lastInterview:''}}</view></view></view><view class="link">查看 →</view></view><view class="summary-copy" style="margin-top:20rpx">{{item.situation || '暂未填写学生情况'}}</view><view wx:if="item.followUpDate" class="badge {{item.needFollowUp?'high':''}}">{{item.needFollowUp?'需要跟进':'下次跟进'}} · {{item.followUpDate}}</view></view><view wx:if="!students.length" class="card empty">暂无符合条件的学生档案。</view><view class="footer-note">档案保存在本机 · 请使用学生代号并定期备份</view></view>
